<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Finance</span><h1>Payments & receipts</h1><p>Submit manual payment proof and follow Accounts verification.</p></div></div><?php if(!$application):?><section class="card empty-state"><span>₹</span><h2>No application yet</h2><p>Start an application before submitting a payment.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="<?= url('student/application') ?>">Start application</a></section><?php else:?><div class="payment-layout"><section class="card payment-instructions"><div class="card-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Manual payment</span><h2>Application fee</h2></div><b class="amount">₹1,000</b></div><div class="bank-placeholder"><span>Payment instructions</span><p>The authorised college administrator must configure verified UPI or bank details before opening applications.</p><code>UPI ID: Not configured</code></div><ol><li><i>1</i>Pay only to the account displayed after configuration.</li><li><i>2</i>Retain the transaction reference and a clear screenshot or PDF.</li><li><i>3</i>Submit below; Accounts will verify before issuing a receipt.</li></ol><div class="compliance-callout"><b>Never pay an unknown account.</b><p>Confirm the configured beneficiary name and contact Admissions if anything appears unusual.</p></div></section><section class="card payment-form-card"><h2>Submit payment proof</h2><p>Fields marked * are required.</p><form method="post" action="<?= url('student/payments') ?>" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="form-grid"><label><span>Amount paid (₹) *</span><input type="number" step=".01" name="amount" value="<?= e(old('amount','1000')) ?>" required></label><label><span>Method *</span><select name="method"><option value="upi">UPI</option><option value="bank_transfer">Bank transfer</option><option value="cash">Cash at college</option></select></label><label><span>Reference number *</span><input name="reference_number" value="<?= e(old('reference_number')) ?>" required><?= error('reference_number')?'<small class="field-error">'.e(error('reference_number')).'</small>':'' ?></label><label><span>Payment date *</span><input type="date" name="paid_at" value="<?= e(old('paid_at',date('Y-m-d'))) ?>" required></label><label class="full file-drop"><span>Receipt / screenshot *</span><input type="file" name="proof" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png" required><small>PDF, JPG or PNG · up to 5 MB</small></label></div><button class="button button-primary button-block">Submit for verification →</button></form></section></div><?php if($payments):?><section class="card table-card"><div class="card-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Payment history</span><h2>Submitted records</h2></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Reference</th><th>Method</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th><th>Receipt</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($payments as $payment):?><tr><td><?= format_date($payment['paid_at']) ?></td><td><b><?= e($payment['reference_number']) ?></b></td><td><?= e(ucwords(str_replace('_',' ',$payment['method']))) ?></td><td><?= money($payment['amount']) ?></td><td><span class="status-pill status-<?= e($payment['status']) ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($payment['status'])) ?></span></td><td><?= $payment['receipt_number']?'<a href="'.url('student/receipts/'.$payment['id']).'">'.e($payment['receipt_number']).'</a>':'—' ?> · <a href="<?= url('files/payment/'.$payment['id']) ?>" target="_blank">proof</a></td></tr><?php endforeach?></tbody></table></div></section><?php endif?><?php endif?>
